+# Intent: bounded batched Arrow construction
+
+Date: November 13, 2026. Requestor: repository user; author: Codex.
+Status: candidate; correctness/measurement pending. Baseline `24f654b7`.
+
+Current wide direct projections bind typed coercion/append callbacks, but each
+cell still calls a builder append/reserve path. Investigate bounded typed
+column staging and AppendValues to reduce that dispatch without materializing
+projected Value rows or changing retrieval. Do not repeat rejected write
+argument-cache/sizing or upstream HMGET experiments.
+
+See [contract](spec.md), [plan](plan.md) and [validation](validation.md).
