+# Plan
+
+1. Inspect current typed/decode/stream lifecycle and pinned Arrow AppendValues
+   implementation; bind only supported physical/logical pairs.
+2. Add 64-row typed staging in scan_arrow.go/scan_arrow_batch.go, preserving all
+   existing fallback/decode/fit/coerce rules and public record boundaries.
+3. Run focused unit/race for complete mixed fields, NULL/default/exact values,
+   maps/HMGET, duplicate aliases, timezone fitting, partial/error order after 63
+   staged rows, retained output, 65-row records and fallback/byte policies.
+4. Run existing live ownership/cancellation/limit/readiness and managed/unmanaged
+   direct projection cases on the parent-owned verified Software 4x-QPF fixture.
+5. Separately measure complete construction versus scalar-control conversion,
+   validating every field before/after timing. Native compare both modes at 100K×105,
+   one/four readers, 512/4096 ceilings, 6 measured plus warmup: 112 trials total.
+   Use unchanged existing workers and independent complete IPC/value validation.
+6. Keep every attempt/negative; no tuning after measurement. Adopt only supported
+   gain; otherwise preserve exact source and evidence with prototype unapplied.
+
+No builds/tests/provisioning/timing before the coordinator grants its slot.
+See [contract](spec.md), [intent](intent.md) and [validation](validation.md).
